# NAME: ChatGPT / OpenAI - iOS AUDIT CANDIDATE
# FORMAT: Surge Rule Set
# VERSION: 2026-10-08-v2-candidate
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Lean ChatGPT/OpenAI rules for Surge iOS.
#   Based on 2026-10-08 iOS runtime observations plus the prior Complete ruleset.
#
# NOTES:
#   - No MITM required.
#   - Shared third-party services are kept exact where practical.
#   - RevenueCat and Google content-storage upload hosts are NOT added yet:
#     observed, but not proven necessary for the dedicated ChatGPT policy.
#   - Legacy / web / enterprise compatibility rules are separated below.
# ============================================================
# CORE — confirmed OpenAI / ChatGPT namespaces
# ============================================================
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com
