# ============================================================
# OBSERVED BUT INTENTIONALLY NOT INCLUDED
# ============================================================
#
# api.revenuecat.com
#   Observed in ChatGPT iOS, but shared third-party subscription infrastructure.
#   Current evidence does not show that it must follow the ChatGPT policy.
#
# gcs-us-00003.content-storage-upload.googleapis.com
#   Observed carrying upload traffic. Host numbering appears potentially dynamic.
#   Do not broaden to DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com.
#
# Shared Sentry suffix is intentionally NOT used:
#   DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io
#
# ============================================================
# COVERAGE NOTES
# ============================================================
#
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com covers, among others:
#   ios.chat.openai.com
#   help.openai.com
#   chat.openai.com
#   *.auth.openai.com
#
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com covers, among others:
